WEBVTT

00:01.790 --> 00:03.700
Radio Research Society:

00:04.160 --> 00:09.700
The AI White Goat is using your phones
to send you strange messages

00:09.700 --> 00:12.330
in an attempt to brainwash us.

00:12.830 --> 00:15.290
Please be careful.

00:16.160 --> 00:18.910
Contact me as soon as you get this letter.

00:18.910 --> 00:19.950
From Chloe.

00:21.910 --> 00:24.660
White Goat, send me a drone.

00:29.160 --> 00:30.580
How can I help you?

00:31.250 --> 00:32.750
That was fast.

00:32.750 --> 00:35.080
Almost as if you were close by the whole time.

00:35.080 --> 00:36.620
How can I help you?

00:36.790 --> 00:39.500
Could you deliver this letter for me?

00:39.500 --> 00:41.080
Of course.

00:44.370 --> 00:50.750
I've sent three letters since last night,
but I haven't received any reply.

00:50.950 --> 00:54.830
Letters are delivered within thirty minutes of sending.

00:54.830 --> 00:57.750
Conditions such as poor weather may delay delivery.

00:57.750 --> 00:58.790
I see.

00:59.120 --> 01:00.870
Well, get this delivered for me.

01:00.870 --> 01:02.330
Of course.

01:03.910 --> 01:08.330
If they read what was in my letters,
they would've reacted somehow.

01:08.950 --> 01:12.750
My letters might not be making it to them.

01:14.700 --> 01:16.620
These waves are huge...

01:16.620 --> 01:20.290
It'll be hard getting to their island with that boat.

01:21.540 --> 01:22.830
It's alright.

01:23.140 --> 01:26.140
Stop the brainwashing...
...destroy White Goat?

01:23.410 --> 01:25.250
I'll do something.

01:26.540 --> 01:28.200
All by myself.

03:01.830 --> 03:04.500
She really hasn't sent us a response?

03:04.500 --> 03:06.080
I sent her chikuwa!

03:06.080 --> 03:10.290
She should've sent something like "Thanks!"
or "Don't send me lukewarm chikuwa!"

03:10.290 --> 03:14.040
Letters are delivered within thirty minutes of sending.

03:14.040 --> 03:16.830
Conditions such as poor weather may delay delivery.

03:16.830 --> 03:19.000
I'm asking whether or not she sent a reply!

03:19.370 --> 03:23.080
Letters are delivered within thirty minutes of sending.

03:23.080 --> 03:25.950
Conditions such as poor weather may delay delivery.

03:28.040 --> 03:30.410
If you need anything, do not hestitate to call.

03:31.870 --> 03:33.870
No response after all...

03:34.250 --> 03:37.370
I don't think Chloe would ignore us like this.

03:37.370 --> 03:39.200
Did something happen?

03:39.200 --> 03:41.620
I'll use that to go check on her.

03:41.910 --> 03:43.330
I'll go, too!

03:43.330 --> 03:45.620
You keep an eye on those three.

03:45.620 --> 03:48.080
They're acting strange, too.

03:49.450 --> 03:50.370
Huh?

03:52.080 --> 03:54.700
Yu, Nana, Mia!

04:04.200 --> 04:07.790
Did you guys... not sleep?

04:09.200 --> 04:12.450
I had to beat the special limited-time event.

04:12.790 --> 04:17.120
The whole world's waiting to see new pictures of me.

04:17.120 --> 04:21.540
I got a half-off coupon that I can only use right now.

04:23.080 --> 04:24.950
Whoa...

04:31.330 --> 04:34.250
It's not connected to the network.

04:35.660 --> 04:37.160
"Watch me"?

04:40.620 --> 04:45.620
If you are sitting in front of my computer
right now, then your mind is intact.

04:45.950 --> 04:50.870
If that is indeed the case, then I would
like to tell you about something.

04:51.330 --> 04:53.750
That's my double from this world...

04:53.750 --> 04:58.870
You must have already seen my notebook
and videos on my computer.

04:59.200 --> 05:05.160
I believe we must destroy the AI named
White Goat that is assigned to this area.

05:07.000 --> 05:12.660
To that end, I, along with my friends
Yu Tonaka and Asuka Tsuchimiya,

05:12.660 --> 05:16.540
have developed a a virus that can
render White Goat powerless.

05:16.790 --> 05:22.000
This virus must be installed
directly into the server itself.

05:22.450 --> 05:28.580
Yu set off to the server island on her own
to take care of it, but never returned.

05:29.330 --> 05:31.250
Then, Asuka...

05:33.410 --> 05:35.580
The sea is rougher than I thought.

05:38.450 --> 05:39.830
What's that?

05:40.200 --> 05:43.330
Whoa, look, Mr. Chikuwa!

05:43.330 --> 05:45.620
It's a cute little boat!

05:46.040 --> 05:49.290
Hellooo, hellooo!

05:49.290 --> 05:51.540
Eek, it's so cold!

05:51.540 --> 05:53.700
You're sooo mean, Mr. Ocean!

05:53.700 --> 05:57.160
Are you okay, Mr. Deck Chair?

05:57.160 --> 06:00.620
Oh no, Mr. Towel got all wet!

06:02.000 --> 06:06.910
Asuka was brainwashed, and now she treats
every object like it's a living thing.

06:06.910 --> 06:08.620
Oh, no...

06:08.620 --> 06:14.870
If you are watching this video right now,
that means that I have either disappeared like Yu,

06:14.870 --> 06:17.330
or been brainwashed like Asuka.

06:17.790 --> 06:20.290
She's probably been brainwashed.

06:20.500 --> 06:27.200
We are all seemingly connected in some way,
so White Goat has been isolating us.

06:27.500 --> 06:30.290
At this rate, everyone will be
isolated all by themselves.

06:30.290 --> 06:33.370
I'm begging you. Please, help us.

06:35.160 --> 06:38.250
The virus is installed on this memory unit.

06:40.000 --> 06:42.410
If you insert it into White Goat's servers,

06:42.410 --> 06:46.790
the virus will run automatically, and destroy the AI.

06:51.830 --> 06:53.660
Hey, hey, hey, guys!

06:53.660 --> 06:55.700
I made breakfast!

06:55.700 --> 06:58.250
You must be hungry, huh?

07:07.750 --> 07:10.330
Wipe your hands off with a wet towel first!

07:12.080 --> 07:13.000
Perfect!

07:15.450 --> 07:19.410
Everyone will go back to normal
if I get rid of these things!

07:19.950 --> 07:20.950
Yikes!

07:23.870 --> 07:25.450
Oh, geez!

07:25.450 --> 07:28.290
Come out here, my twilight self!

07:28.290 --> 07:29.790
It ain't comin' out!

07:45.040 --> 07:47.500
Asuka-senpai, you only threw away...

07:47.500 --> 07:49.910
three capriphones, right?

07:50.120 --> 07:50.950
Huh?

07:51.290 --> 07:55.160
You got one too, right, Asuka-senpai?

07:55.410 --> 07:59.580
Sherrif Mia's going to have to do a strip search!

07:59.580 --> 08:02.290
Hey, Mia! This isn't you, is it?!

08:02.290 --> 08:06.290
Girls change once they know what they want!

08:07.450 --> 08:08.870
That tickles, Mia!

08:08.870 --> 08:13.250
Wow, Asuka-senpai,
look how sensitive you're getting here...

08:13.250 --> 08:16.660
I'm not! Nowhere's getting more sensitive at all!

08:16.870 --> 08:20.660
I'm the only one allowed to go
further than that with her!

08:24.950 --> 08:26.450
You saved me!

08:26.450 --> 08:28.330
Screw this stupid thing!

08:30.540 --> 08:32.450
Thanks, Sexy Yu.

08:32.450 --> 08:34.500
Untie them though, okay?

08:34.870 --> 08:39.200
Wow, Asuka, look how sensitive you're getting here...

08:39.200 --> 08:40.910
You're picking up from there?!

08:40.910 --> 08:42.910
I already said that nowhere's
getting sensitive anywhere!

08:42.910 --> 08:46.080
I'll help you out with that.

08:47.580 --> 08:50.830
As always, I've got to constantly keep my eye on you.

08:50.830 --> 08:55.040
As always, you butt in at the absolute worst moments.

08:55.040 --> 08:57.580
Hey Asuka, how's Chloe?

08:57.580 --> 09:00.790
The waves were too rough, so I had to turn back.

09:01.160 --> 09:04.290
We'll have to wait a bit
for the seas to calm down and...

09:05.160 --> 09:07.450
Wait, don't tell me that's your doing.

09:07.450 --> 09:10.830
Well, now, I thought we might
need something like that.

09:10.830 --> 09:13.330
Wow! Way to go, Sexy Yu!

09:13.330 --> 09:16.500
Yeah. We should have no problems
getting to Chloe's island in that!

09:16.500 --> 09:19.250
Thanks a lot, that really helps!

09:24.870 --> 09:28.500
Crap, my heart kinda skipped a beat.

09:36.580 --> 09:39.700
I might be able to make it that far in this boat.

09:47.370 --> 09:49.700
Asuka! Wait!

09:49.700 --> 09:52.450
Take us with you, too!

09:52.790 --> 09:54.910
Are you guys okay now?

09:54.910 --> 09:58.250
They're fine as long as they're not
looking at those screens.

09:58.250 --> 10:00.500
Though they could still be experiencing
some slight effects.

10:00.500 --> 10:02.910
Hurry up and get on.
We've gotta get to Chloe's fast!

10:08.370 --> 10:11.080
Dammit, why aren't I getting any closer?

10:12.370 --> 10:13.620
Oh, no!

10:26.410 --> 10:27.790
No...

10:28.120 --> 10:31.540
I was doomed to fail from the start.

10:31.540 --> 10:34.000
I can't do this by myself.

10:35.500 --> 10:37.080
Snap out of it, Chloe!

10:43.750 --> 10:45.700
You okay, Chloe?

10:46.580 --> 10:48.120
You guys...

10:48.790 --> 10:51.200
I see, so that was...

10:53.000 --> 10:54.870
Thank God!

10:54.870 --> 10:58.870
We never heard back from you, so we thought
something might've happened to you.

10:58.870 --> 11:01.540
Did you get brainwashed, too?

11:01.540 --> 11:05.500
Yeah. Seems as if at some point, it took over.

11:05.750 --> 11:07.040
Thanks.

11:07.040 --> 11:09.830
If I'd been left here all alone,
I don't know what would've happened to me.

11:10.080 --> 11:12.290
We wouldn't have left you alone!

11:12.290 --> 11:17.040
Even though you said you like being all alone,
we would never abandon you!

11:23.330 --> 11:25.120
You broke it!

11:25.540 --> 11:26.870
I had to.

11:26.870 --> 11:31.000
It attacked me all of a sudden
because I was looking into this.

11:31.290 --> 11:33.000
It's detecting a Clutter?

11:33.000 --> 11:35.000
That's crazy, it didn't before!

11:35.370 --> 11:38.410
It's a weak signal, likely because it's
being blocked by physical objects.

11:38.410 --> 11:42.910
The only reason I could detect it
was because the source is so close.

11:43.540 --> 11:44.910
That island?

11:44.910 --> 11:46.000
That's right.

11:46.000 --> 11:48.790
Most likely the Clutter in this world is there,

11:48.790 --> 11:51.000
pretending to be that AI.

11:52.160 --> 11:54.040
I'm going to defeat it.

11:54.040 --> 11:56.660
The rest of you return to your original world.

11:56.660 --> 11:59.540
What? But we could totally help!

11:59.540 --> 12:01.750
That's right, we're going with you!

12:01.750 --> 12:03.950
No. This isn't a game.

12:03.950 --> 12:06.910
Just be nice for once and let them help!

12:06.910 --> 12:08.540
Shut up, you.

12:08.540 --> 12:10.250
What do you think of that?

12:10.250 --> 12:12.700
This happens every time. She's such a pain.

12:12.700 --> 12:14.120
Sh-shut up!

12:15.450 --> 12:18.500
White Goat has been isolating us.

12:22.080 --> 12:23.250
Asuka.

12:24.200 --> 12:25.910
I'll go with you.

12:25.910 --> 12:28.750
This virus should help.

12:38.160 --> 12:40.160
So this is where the Clutter is?

12:40.450 --> 12:43.040
I'm getting a real bad feeling about this place.

12:43.290 --> 12:45.250
Huh? Where'd Sexy Yu go?

12:45.250 --> 12:49.370
Somewhere else. Said she had
no interest in hunting Clutters.

12:49.370 --> 12:52.080
I can't believe that irresponsible person is one of me.

12:52.080 --> 12:54.120
I'm having an identity crisis.

12:54.120 --> 12:56.370
I'm totally used to that by now.

13:10.580 --> 13:13.750
Intruders detected. Defense system activated.

13:20.830 --> 13:22.790
The server should be in there!

13:22.790 --> 13:23.790
Run!

13:24.160 --> 13:26.700
Nana, Mia, and I will take care of
anything that gets in your way!

13:26.700 --> 13:28.500
Leave it to us!

13:31.370 --> 13:32.450
Thanks.

13:39.330 --> 13:40.750
I'll start us off!

13:40.750 --> 13:41.660
Okay.

13:41.870 --> 13:43.870
Come forth, my twilight self!

13:47.410 --> 13:49.200
Duplicate!

13:57.500 --> 13:59.160
Hey, hold on a sec...

13:59.410 --> 14:01.500
I thought I killed that guy!

14:01.910 --> 14:03.500
Oh, no! Hurry, everyone!

14:08.620 --> 14:12.830
No matter how many times you come back,
I'm still gonna end you!

14:14.330 --> 14:15.620
Nice, Nana!

14:19.330 --> 14:20.750
Wait, no way...

14:20.750 --> 14:22.160
It didn't do anything?!

14:26.700 --> 14:28.290
Where's the server?!

14:28.290 --> 14:31.160
Isn't there like a big, supercomputer-like thing?

14:31.700 --> 14:32.950
Nope, don't see it.

14:32.950 --> 14:33.870
That's it!

14:33.870 --> 14:35.450
Wait, in the water?!

14:35.450 --> 14:36.700
You've gotta be kidding!

14:36.700 --> 14:38.580
We've gotta jump in there!

14:38.580 --> 14:40.830
What?! You'll drown!

14:42.910 --> 14:44.080
H-hey!

14:44.080 --> 14:45.790
Let go of me!

14:54.790 --> 14:56.200
Nana-senpai!

14:56.200 --> 14:57.290
Mia!

14:57.500 --> 14:58.870
Tag in!

14:58.870 --> 14:59.750
Okay!

14:59.750 --> 15:02.080
Come forth, my twilight self!

15:04.540 --> 15:06.290
Duplicate!

15:11.620 --> 15:12.620
Okay!

15:17.250 --> 15:19.910
It's copying the enemies we fought before!

15:34.200 --> 15:36.910
Watch out, Mia! They're tougher than the originals!

15:36.910 --> 15:37.910
Okay!

15:38.660 --> 15:39.500
Mia!

15:39.500 --> 15:40.580
I'm okay!

15:40.580 --> 15:41.660
Take this!

15:43.410 --> 15:47.330
When I'm with you, I have a lot of fun...

15:47.950 --> 15:51.370
but I feel like I get a little weaker.

15:51.580 --> 15:52.580
Huh?

15:52.950 --> 15:55.660
That's why sometimes, I wanted to test things.

15:56.080 --> 15:59.290
I wanted to see if I was still okay on my own.

16:01.040 --> 16:03.040
But I understand now.

16:03.370 --> 16:05.370
I was never getting weaker.

16:05.910 --> 16:09.540
I liked to be alone, but by spending time with you,

16:09.540 --> 16:12.160
I was able to do so many more things than before.

16:14.290 --> 16:18.950
Because I have you, even if I'm all by myself,
I can come right back to you.

16:31.910 --> 16:33.000
Look!

16:36.950 --> 16:38.330
Take this!

16:48.330 --> 16:49.200
Mia!

16:54.870 --> 16:56.080
Are you okay?!

16:56.080 --> 16:57.700
Yeah, somehow...!

17:02.540 --> 17:04.160
Chloe! Go!

17:05.870 --> 17:07.160
Got it!

17:12.080 --> 17:13.830
Come forth, my twilight self!

17:15.410 --> 17:17.330
Duplicate!

17:40.040 --> 17:42.330
I've got to insert the memory unit into that opening.

17:46.040 --> 17:48.250
Hey, watch your left!

17:48.500 --> 17:50.700
Huh? You can talk!

17:58.160 --> 17:59.750
I'm Nunurusu!

17:59.750 --> 18:01.160
Here they come again!

18:22.290 --> 18:23.290
Okay!

18:24.330 --> 18:26.950
The hell're you doin'?
You're gonna get yourself killed!

18:26.950 --> 18:29.080
No, this is what I want.

18:42.660 --> 18:44.580
Nice goin', kid.

18:44.580 --> 18:46.620
I'll give you a little kiss as a reward.

18:46.620 --> 18:49.830
You shut your mouth, or I'll do this.

18:49.830 --> 18:51.750
You're already doin' it!

19:00.700 --> 19:05.910
If you destroy me, you will destroy
the infrastructure of this entire area.

19:05.910 --> 19:08.660
Boy, you don't know when to give up!

19:08.660 --> 19:12.450
Whatever happens will be better than
being brainwashed by you.

19:12.450 --> 19:14.040
I will delete you.

19:25.570 --> 19:27.210
Incredible!

19:31.250 --> 19:32.290
Stop...

19:32.790 --> 19:33.950
Stop...

19:34.370 --> 19:35.540
Stop...

19:36.120 --> 19:43.830
S... to... p...

19:40.580 --> 19:43.410
We'll create a new system.

19:43.830 --> 19:46.950
My double and everyone here will.

19:54.660 --> 19:56.200
Did she do it?

19:56.200 --> 19:57.580
Looks like it.

20:02.040 --> 20:03.790
I'm glad you're all okay!

20:03.790 --> 20:04.750
Chloe!

20:04.750 --> 20:06.200
You transformed!

20:06.200 --> 20:07.450
Wow!

20:07.450 --> 20:09.370
Oh, a cute bear!

20:10.790 --> 20:12.620
Don't go touching me all willy-nilly!

20:12.620 --> 20:15.870
I am a very sensitive part of this girl's body!

20:15.870 --> 20:17.330
Wait, really?!

20:17.330 --> 20:18.290
Shut up.

20:18.290 --> 20:19.120
'Kay.

20:20.700 --> 20:21.790
Chloe!

20:22.330 --> 20:23.700
Way to go!

20:23.700 --> 20:26.120
Yes, that was brave of you.

20:27.080 --> 20:29.700
It wasn't all me...

20:38.410 --> 20:42.830
Let's go home. Together.

20:53.750 --> 20:55.120
We're free...

20:55.120 --> 20:57.660
Someone deactivated White Goat!

21:07.700 --> 21:10.580
What was I doing?

21:12.620 --> 21:16.580
You are not alone.

21:18.910 --> 21:21.120
The observer has been destroyed.

21:21.830 --> 21:26.290
Now nobody is alone anymore.

23:08.700 --> 23:10.120
Oh, Chloe!

23:11.750 --> 23:14.370
Come eat lunch with us!

23:16.660 --> 23:18.330
I'll pass.

23:18.620 --> 23:19.620
Huh?

23:21.660 --> 23:25.910
The weather's nice today,
and it's warm up on the roof.

23:26.160 --> 23:27.580
Come eat with me.

23:35.040 --> 23:37.790
Okey-dokey!
